flowchart TB
  U[User Task] --> ORCH[Task Orchestrator]
  ORCH --> EX
  ORCH --> ST

  subgraph EXEC[Executor Lobe]
    EX[Executor Model]
    EXT[Side-effect Tools<br/>browser · files · shell<br/>API writes · deploy · send]
    EX --- EXT
  end

  subgraph STRAT[Strategist Lobe]
    ST[Strategist Model]
    STT[Sense/Judge Tools<br/>research · memory · risk<br/>tests · verifier · approval]
    ST --- STT
  end

  EX <-->|typed envelopes<br/>plan · intent · permit · verify| ST

  EXT --> TR[Tool Router<br/>exclusive ownership + permit check]
  STT --> TR
  TR --> LEDGER[(Append-only Permission Ledger)]

  EX <--> WS[(Shared Workspace)]
  ST <--> WS
  EX <--> MEM[(Shared Memory)]
  ST <--> MEM

  WATCH[Watchdog<br/>stall · loop · heartbeat] -.-> ORCH
  ORCH --> REPORT[Evidence-backed Final Report]
